  "_comment": "RSNA 2024 Lumbar Spine Degenerative Classification (Kaggle). 3D MRI DICOM stacks organized as train_images/<study_id>/<series_id>/<instance>.dcm. 1975 studies, ~6294 series (3 per study: Sagittal T1, Sagittal T2/STIR, Axial T2). Labels are study-level severity (Normal/Mild, Moderate, Severe) across 25 targets (5 conditions x 5 lumbar levels). We harmonize one row per (study, series); labels are duplicated across a study's series. Labels are expanded into 75 binary columns (25 targets x 3 severities) so they play natively with output_cls.",

